1
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:04,310
(Sheldon:)There should be no value
to his pseudo-celebrity here!

2
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:06,080
(Sheldon:)And even at
Star Trek conventions,

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,880
(Sheldon:)they only let him in
if he helps set up!

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,550
(Leonard:)Calm down, Sheldon.

5
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:11,980
(Sheldon:)I will not calm down.

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:14,990
(Sheldon:)This affront to justice and
decency cannot go unanswered.

7
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:17,820
(Sheldon:)As Captain Jean-Luc Picard
once said,

8
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,910
"The line must be drawn here!

9
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:25,000
"This far, no farther!"

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,630
(Leonard:)Had to wake him up
from his nap, didn't you?

11
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,860
(Bernadette:)You know what I really love
about Howard?

12
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,840
(Bernadette:)His chest hair.

13
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,310
(Penny:)Howard has a
hairy chest?

14
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,510
(Bernadette:)No, just the one.

15
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,950
(Bernadette:)But it's really long.

16
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,990
(Penny:)Okay, there you go--
Sultry Sunrise Red.

17
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,590
(Penny:)What do you think?

18
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:54,360
(Amy:)My nails have never
looked so pretty before.

19
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,530
(Amy:)Get it off.

20
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:01,350
(Raj:)Oh, oh, uh, looks like
they're getting ready

